### 🆕 Add stage: Booking
POST http://localhost:5000/api/jobs/1/stages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stageName": "Booking",
  "pic": "faiz",
  "remarks": "Initial booking created"
}

###

### 🆕 Add stage: Confirmed (with explicit times)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/jobs/1/stages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stageName": "Confirmed",
  "startedAt": "2025-11-20T09:00:00.000Z",
  "endedAt": "2025-11-20T09:05:00.000Z",
  "pic": "faiz",
  "remarks": "Booking confirmed by supervisor"
}

###

### 📄 Get all stages for job 1
GET http://localhost:5000/api/jobs/1/stages
Accept: application/json

###

### 📄 Filter stages by name
GET http://localhost:5000/api/jobs/1/stages?stageName=Confirmed
Accept: application/json

###

### 📅 Filter stages by date range
GET http://localhost:5000/api/jobs/1/stages?from=2025-11-20T00:00:00.000Z&to=2025-11-21T00:00:00.000Z
Accept: application/json
